B.cJu=new A.p(B.acw,["About ","Us","Ammar SAT Academy is a results-driven learning system designed specifically for American Diploma students aiming to achieve high scores in SAT, ACT, and EST exams. Founded by Ammar Adel, the Academy was built on a clear mission: to transform the way students prepare\u2014moving beyond traditional teaching into a structured system that delivers measurable improvement.","At Ammar Academy, preparation is not random practice; it is strategic. Students are trained to understand the logic behind every question, recognize common traps, and apply time-management techniques that maximize performance under real test conditions. Each course combines live interactive sessions with carefully designed recorded lessons, ensuring both engagement and mastery.","What sets Ammar Academy apart is its strong follow-up and accountability system. Students receive weekly assignments, regular mock tests, and continuous performance tracking. Parents are kept informed through detailed progress reports, creating a supportive environment that drives consistency and discipline.","The Academy has helped thousands of students significantly improve their scores, with many achieving outstanding results in SAT English and Math. These successes are not exceptions\u2014they are the outcome of a proven system that focuses on clarity, practice, and feedback.","With a growing community of ambitious students and a commitment to excellence, Ammar SAT Academy continues to set a new standard for test preparation in Egypt and across the Arab world.","Smart preparation leads to smart results."],t.w)
B.acs={title_part1:0,title_part2:1,subtitle:2,effective_date:3,intro:4,s1_title:5,s1_p1:6,s1_p2:7,s1_p3:8,s1_p4:9,s1_p4_b1:10,s1_p4_b2:11,s1_p4_b3:12,s1_p5:13,s2_title:14,s2_p1:15,s2_p1_b1:16,s2_p1_b2:17,s2_p1_b3:18,s2_p1_b4:19,s2_p2:20,s3_title:21,s3_intro:22,s3_b1:23,s3_b2:24,s3_b3:25,s3_b4:26,s3_b5:27,s3_p1:28,s4_title:29,s4_p1:30,s4_p2:31,s4_p3:32,s5_title:33,s5_p1:34,s5_b1:35,s5_b2:36,s5_p2:37,s6_title:38,s6_p1:39}
B.cqi=new A.p(B.acs,["Privacy ","& Policy","Student Policy and Registration Terms - Ammar Academy","Effective from June 2025","By registering in one of the SAT, ACT, or EST preparation programs offered by Ammar Academy, the student and their guardian acknowledge and agree to all the following policies and terms:","1. Attendance and Participation Policy","Students must attend all live sessions and follow recorded videos weekly.","Participation in weekly tests and homework submission is an essential part of the evaluation.","In case of absence, a written excuse must be sent within 48 hours.","Acceptable excuses include:","Medical conditions (with supporting documentation)","School exams or academic circumstances","Travel or urgent family circumstances","Repeated unexcused absences lead to cancellation of the free re-enrollment privilege or exclusion from study groups.","2. Free Course Re-enrollment Policy","Students are entitled to re-enroll in the course more than once with an administrative fee of 700 EGP per subject for each re-enrollment, subject to the Academy's available schedule, provided that:","Attendance of at least 70% of live sessions","Completion of at least 50% of assignments and tests","A verified written excuse in case of prolonged absence","Re-enrollment request submitted within 7 days of course end or at least one month before the new course starts","An administrative fee of only 700 EGP is collected upon re-enrollment.","3. Refund Policy","In case of withdrawal from the course after registration, fees are refunded according to the following policy:","If registration is cancelled before the course starts: 90% of the paid fees are refunded.","If withdrawal occurs during the first week: 70% of the fees are refunded.","If withdrawal occurs during the second week: 50% of the fees are refunded.","If withdrawal occurs after the second week: no refund is applicable.","If the course is cancelled by the Academy: 100% of the amount is refunded.","Refund requests must be submitted in writing via email or official WhatsApp, and the refund process takes 10 to 15 business days.","4. Student Conduct and Academic Integrity","All students are expected to maintain proper conduct, mutual respect, and refrain from cheating or copying assignments.","Sharing educational materials with others outside the course is prohibited.","Any violation may result in immediate dismissal without fee refund.","5. Official Communication Channels","Communication with students is conducted through:","Course-specific WhatsApp groups","Email: info@ammaracademy.com","Monthly performance reports are sent to parents when needed.","6. Policy Acknowledgment","By confirming registration, the student and their guardian are considered to have agreed to all the above terms and policies. This policy aims to ensure a fair and organized educational environment that helps students achieve the best possible performance."],t.w)
